== 4. Wright's minimal crosstalk model: Bernstein-Vazirani with the secret 01 on ions 0 and 2, the middle ion the ancilla (Section 9.6 row 6)
  crosstalk eps = 0.0128 (nearest neighbours); exact register data-string populations {'00': '1.81e-03', '01': '9.98e-01', '10': '6.87e-07', '11': '3.87e-04'}
  coherent crosstalk alone (compiled circuit as matrices, ideal MS) {'00': '2.22e-03', '01': '9.97e-01', '10': '9.15e-07', '11': '4.11e-04'}: the 1 -> 0 flip (00) already leads the 0 -> 1 flip (11) by 5.39 because the oracle CNOT maps the ancilla's crosstalk rotations onto its control, the secret's 1 bit, while the 0 bit sees only the ancilla pulses' direct rotations
  exact DECLARED distribution through the POVM {'00': '2.41e-03', '01': '9.97e-01', '10': '1.76e-06', '11': '7.32e-04'}: the 1 -> 0 flip of the secret (00) 2.41e-03 against the 0 -> 1 flip (11) 7.32e-04, ratio 3.30; per-ion eps_B 6.11e-04 against eps_D 3.47e-04
  register 1 - F = 4.344e-03; budget total 1.7e-02
MC: BV histogram over 4000 shots {'011': 0.9942, '001': 0.0035, '010': 0.0013, '111': 0.0008, '000': 0.0003}

